'''Agent Kapustin''' was an [[NPC]] located at {{Coordinates|32|76|57}} in {{zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. They served no purpose apart from talking about the discontinued [[Operation Mayhem]] and guarding the [[Snowball Fight Cave]].

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
!Condition
!Dialogue
|-
| class="ct" | None
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &cAgent Kapustin&f: Hey [Player]!
&e[NPC] &cAgent Kapsutin&f: My crew is preparing Operation Mayhem in the caves.
&e[NPC] &cAgent Kapsutin&f: Don't tell anyone, it's top secret!
}}
|}

== Trivia ==
*'''Agent Kapustin''' seemed to be the leader of the other Agents of [[Operation Mayhem]].
*'''Agent Kapustin''' may be a reference to the Russian-language surname [[w:Kapustin|Kapustin]].

