'''Dean''' is an [[NPC]] found in the {{Zone|Cathedral}} on the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}} and one of the main NPCs in the [[Mage Faction]] [[Crimson Isle Main Questline|Questline]].

== Quest ==
'''Dean''' first appears in the [[Mage Faction]] [[Crimson Isle Main Questline|Questline]] after {{NPCSprite|Elle}} tasks the player with giving them an {{Item|Maddox Batphone}}. In return, he grants the {{Item|Letter of Recommendation}}, which can be given to {{NPCSprite|Queen Nyx}} to join the [[Mage Faction]].

Not much further into the quest, the player is tasked with calling '''Dean''' on an [[Abiphone]], after which he instructs the player to meet him and several other [[NPCs]] in the {{Zone|Mage Council}}. There, they discuss stolen research, which the player must retrieve from inside {{Zone|The Bastion}}.

After retrieving the research, '''Dean''' asks the player to find his lost {{NPCSprite|Apprentice (Crimson Isle);Apprentice}}, who is located just north of the {{Zone|Burning Desert}}. Upon finding him, he then asks the player to bring him {{Item|Magma Chunk|amount=10}}s and {{Item|Burning Eye|amount=5}}s, which the Apprentice was originally supposed to bring him.

'''Dean''' then uses these resources for his work, and in the meanwhile, tasks the player with completing quests for {{NPCSprite|Odexar}} and {{NPCSprite|Igrupan}}. After this, '''Dean''' then asks for {{Item|Hallowed Skull|amount=1}}, {{Item|Lumino Fiber|amount=1}} and {{Item|Leather Cloth|amount=1}}. After providing these, the player is tasked with speaking to {{NPCSprite|Captain Ahone}}, which leads to the player having to defeat [[Kuudra]]. Once this occurs, speaking to '''Dean''' again will complete the main questline.

