== Trivia ==
* Completing Fetchur's quest for the first time grants the player the {{ach|Helpful Hand|ach=true}}.
* If the reward is claimed during a [[2x Powder]] event, the chat will still incorrectly state that only {{Mithril Powder|2,500}} was given to the player.
