== Trivia ==
*The chicken by the name of Chickovsky is likely a reference to a Russian composer Pyotr Ilyich Tchaikovsky.
*The chicken, Chikira, is a possible reference to a Colombian singer Shakira.
*Igrupan's Minigame is possible a reference to the cucco minigames in ''The Legend Of Zelda'' series.
*One of Igrupan's responses to being below {{Reputation|mage|7,000}} is likely referencing an often satirized quote from controversial community member Larucus:
<div style="margin-left: 3em; font-style: italic;"> "get a reputation before you talk, cause in my eyes, you ain't got one. Maintain your position for a long time in relevancy, then we'll talk again"<ref>https://discord.com/channels/720585022624628797/720602225486856233/879410787096076348</ref></div>

