== Trivia ==
* '''Jacob''' is the first NPC shown to be directly affected by an active [[Mayor]].
* Bulk Claiming [[Jacob's Farming Contest|Contest]] rewards at Jacob has a limit of only being able to claim the rewards from {{Green|28}} (one full page) contests at once.
** If you have more than {{Green|28}} contest rewards to claim, Jacob will say:
{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Jacob&f: Hot diggity, that's a lot of medals! I gave ya some rewards, speak with me if you're interested in the rest.}}
* If a contest is close enough, the 2nd message from surpassing your [[Anita|Personal Best]] may interrupt the dialogue from the end of the event, in which case the dialogue will finish prematurely.
* He is a brother-in-law to {{NPCSprite|Finnegan}}, which implies at least one of them is married.

