'''Sirius''' hosts the {{Zone|Dark Auction}}. Every {{Green|3}} [[Time Systems|SkyBlock Days]] (1 real-life hour) at approximately the 55th minute of every hour, '''Sirius''' will stand outside the Dark Auction and allow players with over {{c|400,000}} to enter. Players who do not have sufficient coins will not be allowed to enter the lobby, and only the richest players will be able to enter. 

